# vehje-runtime-abi. tier-tagged C ABI

The framework's compiler-to-runtime C ABI. A `Checked` residual crosses
tier-tagged: a flat serialized IR arena (baseline), an optimized bytecode,
or native code. Pure `#[repr(C)]` type surface plus the runtime-environment
interface descriptor. No runtime logic. Bare primitives appear only at the
`#[repr(C)]` wire boundary (the documented FFI exception). `#![no_std]`,
no alloc.
